\title{Bohr set}
\taxon{Definition}
\date{2024-01-15}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{Let #{\Gamma \subseteq \hat{G}} and #{\rho > 0}. By the \em{Bohr set} #{B(\Gamma, \rho)} we mean}

##{B(\Gamma, \rho) = \lbrace x \in G : |\gamma(x) - 1| \leq \rho\; \forall \gamma \in \Gamma\rbrace .}

\p{We call #{|\Gamma|} the \em{rank} and #{\rho} the \em{radius} of the Bohr set.}
